>> Animal := Objè nouvo.
>> Factory := Objè nouvo.

Animal lè: ['nouvo'] fè: {
	>> animal := tèt-li nouvo.
	animal sound: ['?']. <- animal.
}.

Animal lè: ['sound:'] fè: { :s
	pwòp sound := s.
}.

Animal lè: ['sound'] fè: { <- pwòp sound.
}.

>> Dog := Objè nouvo.
>> Cat := Objè nouvo.

Dog lè: ['nouvo'] fè: { <- Animal nouvo sound: ['woof!'].
}.

Cat lè: ['nouvo'] fè: { <- Animal nouvo sound: ['meow!'].
}.

Sòti ekri: Dog nouvo sound, nouvo-liy.
Sòti ekri: Cat nouvo sound, nouvo-liy.

Factory lè: ['mix:and:'] fè: { :beast1 :beast2 <- Animal nouvo sound: (
		( beast1 sound soti-nan: 0 longè: 2 ) +
		( beast2 sound soti-nan: 2 longè: 5 )
	).
}.

Sòti ekri: (Factory mix: Dog nouvo and: Cat nouvo) sound, nouvo-liy.
